WEBVTT

00:43.501 --> 00:48.298
DOONA!

00:50.050 --> 00:52.218
You can't see anything now

00:52.302 --> 00:54.095
Both your eyes are blinded

00:54.179 --> 00:56.306
And you got a no choices

00:56.389 --> 00:58.058
I hypnotize you

00:58.141 --> 01:02.228
Screaming out so loud

01:02.312 --> 01:05.231
Screaming in my heart is the spell, love

01:06.983 --> 01:09.903
I got this fire, fire…

01:43.937 --> 01:44.771
Doona.

01:45.480 --> 01:46.356
Lee Doona.

01:47.190 --> 01:48.191
Wake up.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.235
Lee Doona!

02:18.847 --> 02:23.726
EPISODE 2
GETTING TO KNOW EACH OTHER

02:30.900 --> 02:33.736
Jeong-hun consumes
150 grams of protein a day.

02:36.030 --> 02:39.117
His sole concern is
the peace and comfort of his own being.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.704
Straighten your elbows out tautly.
That's it. Breathe in.

02:42.787 --> 02:44.205
He has firm views on dating.

02:44.289 --> 02:46.207
The population is exploding
out of control.

02:46.291 --> 02:48.084
Propagation isn't needed right now.

02:48.168 --> 02:51.588
Human reproductive function
and libido should be curbed.

02:51.671 --> 02:54.132
In some ways, that could be
our evolutionary path, right?

02:58.094 --> 03:00.597
Just ignore him, baby. He's a nutcase.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.223
- Yeah?
- Baby, say "Ah."

03:02.307 --> 03:04.350
Yun-taek's nickname is
the Hundred-Day Prince.

03:04.434 --> 03:05.685
- Right?
- Have some more.

03:05.768 --> 03:07.687
He dreams of a fated love

03:07.770 --> 03:10.565
but can't last more than 100 days
without getting dumped.

03:11.774 --> 03:15.695
Of course, it's not possible to know
what everyone's stories are.

03:30.376 --> 03:33.213
Because we all have
a true version of ourselves

03:34.297 --> 03:36.007
that we wish to hide from the world.

04:08.206 --> 04:11.876
I sent you a screenshot of the message
the boss sent me yesterday.

04:12.460 --> 04:14.504
That's the one, right? Yeah, okay.

04:22.929 --> 04:23.763
Hey!

04:40.321 --> 04:41.489
EDWARD

04:41.572 --> 04:44.242
Thank God I was able
to hire you so quickly.

04:44.325 --> 04:46.911
Last week,
Alice and I thought we were going to die.

04:47.954 --> 04:49.122
Oh, here she comes.

04:50.540 --> 04:51.708
No way!

04:52.709 --> 04:53.793
You're Edward?

04:54.627 --> 04:55.878
Do you two know each other?

04:57.255 --> 04:58.214
Yes!

05:00.591 --> 05:01.634
What a coincidence.

05:02.552 --> 05:03.636
Welcome on board.

05:08.182 --> 05:10.143
- Hi.
- Hello, welcome.

05:10.226 --> 05:12.520
- Can I have an iced Americano, please?
- Sure thing.

05:12.603 --> 05:14.772
Your iced hazelnut is ready.

05:14.856 --> 05:16.024
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

05:16.107 --> 05:17.942
Enjoy your coffee.

05:18.443 --> 05:19.777
Thank you.

05:48.848 --> 05:50.058
LEE DOONA
MISSED CALL

05:51.476 --> 05:52.477
Ah, so cold!

05:54.187 --> 05:55.897
- Here you go.
- Oh, thanks.

06:02.612 --> 06:03.571
This is nice.

06:10.703 --> 06:11.704
You make good coffee.

06:12.205 --> 06:13.831
- It's good, isn't it?
- Yes.

06:16.292 --> 06:19.253
MARCH 2021 MOCK EXAM SCHOLARSHIP
1ST PLACE YANGJIN HIGH SCHOOL LEE WON-JUN

06:19.337 --> 06:21.422
2ND PLACE
YANGJIN GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL KIM JIN-JU

06:27.053 --> 06:28.471
KIM JIN-JU
YANGJIN GIRLS' HIGH

06:36.187 --> 06:37.355
There's Kim Jin-ju.

06:37.438 --> 06:38.689
You know her?

06:39.315 --> 06:43.277
Her family owns our restaurant's building.
They're super-duper rich.

06:45.488 --> 06:46.572
Yu-i is there too.

06:47.156 --> 06:48.699
Hey, I'll be right back.

07:07.218 --> 07:08.094
Excuse me.

07:10.012 --> 07:11.639
I hear you're good at math.

07:12.723 --> 07:14.392
Could you help me with this?

07:24.819 --> 07:25.820
- Here.
- Thank you.

07:27.780 --> 07:29.198
Triangle…

07:33.619 --> 07:34.454
Cosine…

07:37.623 --> 07:38.749
Are you headed home?

07:39.250 --> 07:41.335
No, I have a tutoring job to go to.

07:43.713 --> 07:45.631
I work a lot, don't I?

07:46.257 --> 07:48.342
Is there something going on?

07:48.968 --> 07:50.803
Are you worried my family went bankrupt?

07:50.887 --> 07:52.638
No. That's not what I meant.

07:53.431 --> 07:54.682
I'm glad everything's fine.

08:14.410 --> 08:17.330
ALICE

08:22.376 --> 08:23.711
Whenever I have tuna,

08:23.794 --> 08:26.881
I always kind of feel like
I've made it in life, you know?

08:27.381 --> 08:29.550
I'm going to lay down a bed of rice

08:29.634 --> 08:33.179
then this tuna viscera chopsticks…

08:33.262 --> 08:34.639
Tuna viscera chopsticks?

08:35.389 --> 08:37.850
I have to warn you,
this is incredibly salty.

08:37.934 --> 08:39.602
It's so salty that…

08:40.353 --> 08:41.729
MOM

08:41.812 --> 08:43.814
Next, you wrap it like this.

08:46.400 --> 08:48.986
It's like assembling sushi.
You know what I mean, right?

08:49.695 --> 08:51.614
You need some sesame oil and salt mixture.

08:52.657 --> 08:55.868
I wanted to have this
with warm cooked rice like this today.

09:26.816 --> 09:28.484
DOONA

09:29.277 --> 09:32.613
The number you're trying to reach
is currently unavailable.

09:32.697 --> 09:35.575
Please leave a message after the tone.

09:45.585 --> 09:48.713
Didn't we agree
you wouldn't keep a personal cell phone?

09:50.006 --> 09:52.758
There are times
when I want to hear your voice, you know?

09:57.138 --> 09:58.347
Don't cause any trouble.

10:07.898 --> 10:09.734
You're so cute.

10:11.277 --> 10:12.653
You like me, don't you?

10:13.946 --> 10:17.533
But don't like people too much.
It's better to keep out of their way.

10:17.617 --> 10:19.368
There are lots of bad people out there.

10:23.998 --> 10:27.543
Wow, you're a genius cat.
You understood me right away.

10:27.627 --> 10:30.546
I'm sorry.

10:32.757 --> 10:33.674
Are you hurt?

10:41.515 --> 10:44.310
- You're bleeding.
- It's okay. It doesn't hurt.

10:47.313 --> 10:48.564
Where were you?

10:49.231 --> 10:50.524
I called you.

10:50.608 --> 10:51.525
I was working.

10:51.609 --> 10:52.443
Tutoring?

10:52.526 --> 10:55.571
No, at a café. I haven't been able
to get a tutoring job yet.

11:00.201 --> 11:02.662
Do you know what I hate the most?

11:03.871 --> 11:05.748
- Bad singing?
- Nope.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.293
Not picking up my calls.

11:12.505 --> 11:13.839
How should I put it?

11:15.132 --> 11:16.926
It makes me feel abandoned.

11:18.886 --> 11:22.264
- It fucking sucks.
- Oh, I was working.

11:26.686 --> 11:28.521
It wasn't aimed at you.

11:30.064 --> 11:31.273
You should get some rest.

11:34.276 --> 11:37.905
Why did you call? Did something happen?

11:40.324 --> 11:41.701
I wanted to hear your voice.

11:43.369 --> 11:44.954
So pick up next time.

12:32.460 --> 12:33.711
Hello, this is Companion,

12:33.794 --> 12:36.005
the 44th Civil Engineering
Student Association.

12:36.088 --> 12:38.340
To kick off the new semester…

12:38.424 --> 12:40.634
Due to a study group meeting,
I will not be…

12:40.718 --> 12:43.763
It's 20,000 won to attend,
50,000 won to decline.

12:47.266 --> 12:48.642
I will attend.

12:56.734 --> 12:58.068
START OF TERM PARTY!

12:59.361 --> 13:00.863
- Patriotic!
- Minsong!

13:00.946 --> 13:02.448
- Flourishing!
- Engineering!

13:02.531 --> 13:03.574
- Brilliant!
- CED!

13:03.657 --> 13:07.620
- We are Civil!
- Engineering!

13:07.703 --> 13:08.829
Cheers!

13:09.663 --> 13:11.290
Let's make some noise!

13:25.638 --> 13:28.307
This quarter's overseas business results

13:28.390 --> 13:31.852
depend entirely
on the KCON 2022 JAPAN performance.

13:31.936 --> 13:35.147
The single showcase after KCON 2022 JAPAN
will be our largest ever.

13:35.231 --> 13:38.609
We plan to expand the media showcase
to the scale of a full concert.

13:38.692 --> 13:41.153
- For KCON…
- Doona. Lee Doona.

14:07.263 --> 14:10.474
Hey, you left some at the bottom, asshole!

14:10.558 --> 14:14.103
- What's that face for? Hey!
- Hey, pour a round. Quickly.

14:14.186 --> 14:15.604
LEE DOONA

14:15.688 --> 14:18.107
- Why are you giving me that face?
- Fucking stop that!

14:18.190 --> 14:20.651
- I'm sorry.
- That's not good enough. Let go of me.

14:20.734 --> 14:22.319
- I'm sorry.
- Drink this, then.

14:22.403 --> 14:24.154
- If you're sorry, drink.
- I'm sorry.

14:24.238 --> 14:26.031
- All right. Sit down.
- Hey.

14:26.949 --> 14:27.783
Hello?

14:28.284 --> 14:29.660
Hel-low or hel-high?

14:30.327 --> 14:32.121
That's such a bad dad joke.

14:33.998 --> 14:36.458
Where are you? I'm…

14:37.042 --> 14:38.586
Hello, how are you?

14:40.045 --> 14:42.840
You're the pretty lady I saw at school
the other day, aren't you?

14:42.923 --> 14:44.133
Come on, give it back.

14:46.302 --> 14:48.220
Come on, stop ignoring me and answer me.

14:48.304 --> 14:50.264
- Give it back.
- Hello? Anybody there?

14:50.347 --> 14:52.892
- Cut it out and give me back my phone!
- What the…

14:55.311 --> 14:58.063
- What the hell are you looking at?
- Hey, you!

15:08.866 --> 15:09.783
Did he hit you?

15:10.284 --> 15:11.201
Not yet.

15:13.871 --> 15:15.915
How dare you hit my Won-jun?

15:16.498 --> 15:17.333
What year are you?

15:18.709 --> 15:20.336
Take your filthy hands off me.

15:20.419 --> 15:24.757
You think you can act all entitled now?
You're starting to piss me off.

15:24.840 --> 15:27.718
And what are you going to
fucking do about it, fuckface?

15:27.801 --> 15:30.054
Watch yourself.
I have a weapon in my hand.

15:30.137 --> 15:31.680
- Hey, look…
- Go for it.

15:32.848 --> 15:33.891
Do it, then.

15:35.142 --> 15:38.479
Hey, go on. Go right ahead.

15:40.022 --> 15:41.440
Don't cause any trouble.

15:42.816 --> 15:45.402
You pissed? Hit me, then.

15:46.070 --> 15:47.947
Stop waving it around if you can't do it.

15:48.030 --> 15:49.740
- You think I can't?
- Do it, then!

16:10.970 --> 16:13.597
PHARMACY

16:41.291 --> 16:42.543
I'm absolutely fine.

16:42.626 --> 16:44.878
It's for me. I'm the one who needs it.

16:52.845 --> 16:53.679
That's bitter.

16:55.014 --> 16:57.433
If you hit people over the head
with wine bottles,

16:57.516 --> 16:59.852
you'll get arrested on the spot.
You know that?

16:59.935 --> 17:01.395
He was asking for it.

17:14.033 --> 17:15.951
I don't know what you've been through,

17:16.035 --> 17:19.079
but if you're having problems
with anger management,

17:19.955 --> 17:22.458
you can get therapy for that.

17:25.544 --> 17:28.005
Why? Do I look like
I've been through something?

17:28.756 --> 17:31.133
Well, it's not entirely normal
to walk around

17:31.216 --> 17:34.219
with a wine bottle
to smash someone's head in with.

17:35.137 --> 17:36.972
I bought it because I happened to see it,

17:38.474 --> 17:40.225
and I wanted to drink it with you.

17:45.689 --> 17:46.690
Then let's drink.

17:47.399 --> 17:48.525
What's stopping us?

17:57.201 --> 17:58.494
Are you treating us?

17:59.203 --> 18:01.872
Yes! Let's choose what to have. Come on.

18:01.955 --> 18:03.373
How about fried chicken?

18:03.457 --> 18:05.542
- I love it!
- Fried chicken and beer, then?

18:05.626 --> 18:06.794
We need whelks too.

18:10.547 --> 18:12.466
- I'm hungry all of a sudden.
- How many?

18:12.549 --> 18:14.009
This is so awesome!

18:15.719 --> 18:17.805
- Let me go say hi.
- Sure.

18:17.888 --> 18:18.889
Won-jun!

18:21.183 --> 18:23.560
- Are you here for the party?
- Yes. You too?

18:23.644 --> 18:24.812
Yes!

18:25.395 --> 18:26.396
You're with someone.

18:26.480 --> 18:31.026
Oh, we live in the same house. She…

18:32.152 --> 18:33.237
Aren't you Lee Doona?

18:33.904 --> 18:36.782
Kook Su-jin was a huge fan, right?

18:37.407 --> 18:38.617
I'm a fan of yours.

18:41.328 --> 18:42.663
I'm off. I'm tired.

18:43.330 --> 18:47.584
Oh, excuse me, but do you drink?

18:47.668 --> 18:49.753
Would it be okay
if we had a drink together?

18:50.254 --> 18:52.923
Why would I drink with someone
I don't even know?

18:53.715 --> 18:55.217
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

19:00.180 --> 19:01.014
I'm…

19:02.349 --> 19:03.308
I…

19:04.393 --> 19:05.561
I'm…

19:07.062 --> 19:08.313
a shy person.

19:08.397 --> 19:10.732
- A really shy person, actually.
- Right.

19:14.528 --> 19:16.363
But you're lucky.

19:16.446 --> 19:18.490
I'm telling you, you're lucky.

19:19.992 --> 19:20.826
I know!

19:21.910 --> 19:23.078
But I'm…

19:24.872 --> 19:26.874
I'm the kind of person everyone likes!

19:30.919 --> 19:32.296
I bet he likes me too.

19:33.255 --> 19:34.381
Hey, Won-jun.

19:35.507 --> 19:36.967
Do you not like me anymore?

19:39.469 --> 19:42.139
Who cares if he likes you or not?
He's not important.

19:43.056 --> 19:44.016
Hey, Jin-ju!

19:44.850 --> 19:46.476
Marry me.

19:46.560 --> 19:48.729
I want to marry you too.

19:48.812 --> 19:51.148
- Let's get married!
- Let's get married!

19:53.609 --> 19:56.904
Jin-ju, don't you need to get going?
You might have missed the last bus.

19:56.987 --> 19:58.238
We have to get married.

19:58.322 --> 20:00.741
Be quiet. We're going to get married.

20:03.410 --> 20:05.412
You missed the last bus though.

20:08.081 --> 20:10.167
- Jin-ju.
- Yeah.

20:10.250 --> 20:12.836
Crash at my place tonight.

20:13.670 --> 20:15.297
Actually, just live here.

20:17.174 --> 20:18.425
You can have all of this.

20:18.926 --> 20:21.970
- I'll give you everything.
- I've been needing a place to stay.

20:22.054 --> 20:23.764
Thank you!

20:24.264 --> 20:25.766
You're crazy!

20:26.266 --> 20:27.142
Hey,

20:28.727 --> 20:30.229
are you crazy?

20:31.855 --> 20:33.732
You must be crazy.

20:34.733 --> 20:36.526
Hey, wake up.

20:37.527 --> 20:38.904
Hey, you sleeping?

20:39.529 --> 20:41.990
Come on, why are you sleeping?

20:42.699 --> 20:43.825
You're crazy.

20:44.618 --> 20:45.702
Jin-ju, wake up.

20:45.786 --> 20:47.746
Your dad's calling. Jin-ju!

20:47.829 --> 20:48.705
What's wrong?

20:48.789 --> 20:50.707
What should I do?
We should probably answer.

20:50.791 --> 20:51.917
Answer it, then.

20:52.000 --> 20:53.543
How can I answer it? I'm a man.

20:56.755 --> 20:57.881
You're a man?

20:59.341 --> 21:01.802
- He says he's a man.
- Oh, what do I do?

21:03.553 --> 21:04.763
Oh, no, you shouldn't.

21:04.846 --> 21:05.681
Hello?

21:11.061 --> 21:12.729
Oh, hello, Mr. Kim.

21:12.813 --> 21:15.274
I'm Jin-ju's friend
from the Korean Lit department.

21:15.357 --> 21:17.567
I'm Lee Se-na.

21:17.651 --> 21:20.404
The Start of Term party finished
a bit late tonight,

21:20.487 --> 21:22.489
so Jin-ju's decided
to stay over at my place.

21:23.657 --> 21:24.574
Oh, where's Jin-ju?

21:24.658 --> 21:28.370
She just went to take a shower.
Should I tell her to call you?

21:29.454 --> 21:31.623
Yes, of course. Everything is fine.

21:32.374 --> 21:35.919
Oh, of course!
Yes, my parents are here with us.

21:36.670 --> 21:39.131
I will. Bye, Mr. Kim.

21:43.093 --> 21:46.596
Wow, you're a pro. That was phenomenal.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.514
Boom!

21:48.015 --> 21:50.726
You should have gone into acting
instead of becoming an idol.

21:59.985 --> 22:01.570
I'm going for a smoke.

22:02.696 --> 22:03.947
You should go home.

22:22.257 --> 22:23.383
I told you to go home.

22:23.467 --> 22:26.553
Oh, Yun-taek told me
not to come home before 2 a.m.

22:27.387 --> 22:28.430
I'll go in a bit.

22:53.330 --> 22:55.499
Why are your hands so rough?

22:56.249 --> 22:57.292
Excuse me?

22:59.544 --> 23:01.588
Weirdly, I seem to injure myself
every time I see you.

23:02.798 --> 23:04.424
Maybe we're not meant to hang out.

23:07.052 --> 23:08.470
She's pretty.

23:09.471 --> 23:10.430
Jin-ju.

23:12.808 --> 23:13.934
I guess.

23:19.064 --> 23:20.232
I'm jealous.

23:23.026 --> 23:25.904
You're jealous of her
because she's pretty?

23:28.240 --> 23:29.741
I meant you.

23:32.994 --> 23:37.707
You have a good relationship
with someone you've known for a long time.

23:38.917 --> 23:40.127
I'm jealous of that.

23:46.800 --> 23:47.717
So freaking jealous.

23:50.887 --> 23:53.181
I can't seem to manage that, myself.

23:54.933 --> 23:58.770
Hey, be careful.
You've been drinking and… God.

23:58.854 --> 24:02.357
How did I end up like this?

24:48.028 --> 24:49.863
You're adorable.

24:50.614 --> 24:52.199
I almost did it.

24:52.949 --> 24:55.160
- Did what?
- Turn away next time.

24:55.660 --> 24:57.037
If you can.

25:24.940 --> 25:27.108
Hey, be careful. You've been drinking and…

26:20.745 --> 26:22.289
I did wash it properly.

26:22.872 --> 26:25.041
Interesting, it still smells of you.

26:25.125 --> 26:26.918
I guess it's the fabric softener.

26:29.713 --> 26:31.548
Did you get home all right yesterday?

26:31.631 --> 26:34.092
Doona told me she didn't see you leave.

26:34.175 --> 26:35.093
When did you leave?

26:35.176 --> 26:36.803
I just remembered!

26:36.886 --> 26:39.514
I haven't had a chance to thank her yet.

26:40.974 --> 26:43.143
I was so shocked,
thanks to a certain someone.

26:43.226 --> 26:44.060
Who?

26:45.186 --> 26:47.480
You don't have to hide it from me,
come on.

26:48.189 --> 26:49.107
I saw it.

26:50.483 --> 26:51.860
You and Doona kissing.

26:53.528 --> 26:55.238
Kiss? Me?

26:55.322 --> 26:56.156
Yes.

26:57.032 --> 26:58.325
Oh, it's Se-hun.

26:58.408 --> 26:59.576
Se-hun!

27:00.410 --> 27:02.621
I'd better go.
I'll see you at the café, Won-jun.

27:02.704 --> 27:04.331
Oh, but…

27:17.469 --> 27:18.803
That's not true.

27:36.321 --> 27:37.906
This is a milk container.

27:40.200 --> 27:41.910
Cosmetics. So this is general waste.

27:43.495 --> 27:45.622
I bet your manager did this
for you in the past.

27:45.705 --> 27:47.749
It's obvious
you've never done this before.

27:50.085 --> 27:51.294
Why are you so irritable?

27:51.378 --> 27:52.545
Are you hangry?

27:54.047 --> 27:55.382
Did Jin-ju reject you?

27:56.383 --> 27:59.386
What's Jin-ju got to do
with anything? Jeez.

28:00.845 --> 28:02.097
Oh, this is a plastic bag.

28:02.722 --> 28:04.265
I guess I was right on target.

28:05.725 --> 28:07.519
Gotta ask someone out to get rejected.

28:08.311 --> 28:10.605
Jin-ju thinks you and I are dating.

28:10.689 --> 28:11.523
What?

28:11.606 --> 28:13.858
Really? Why?

28:13.942 --> 28:16.903
She says she saw us that day
on the rooftop.

28:17.487 --> 28:18.446
When we…

28:19.406 --> 28:20.240
we…

28:25.328 --> 28:26.955
You should have set her straight.

28:28.081 --> 28:31.876
Well, it's not like
Jin-ju and I are an item.

28:31.960 --> 28:33.837
It would be weirder trying to explain it.

28:34.337 --> 28:35.839
Then what should we do?

28:36.423 --> 28:38.091
Do we need to date for real?

28:40.135 --> 28:42.470
Why doesn't it surprise me
that you have no friends?

28:51.938 --> 28:52.939
And why don't I?

28:53.022 --> 28:56.818
You spit out whatever is on your mind,
whatever you want to say.

28:57.610 --> 28:59.487
There aren't many people like that.

28:59.571 --> 29:02.824
You don't care
if people get the wrong idea about you.

29:02.907 --> 29:04.200
You don't need to hold back.

29:05.493 --> 29:06.745
In some ways, I envy you.

29:08.246 --> 29:11.124
What the heck? This is also general waste.

29:15.128 --> 29:15.962
Yes.

29:16.713 --> 29:17.589
You're right.

29:18.715 --> 29:21.342
I do whatever the fuck I want
regardless of what others say.

29:22.343 --> 29:23.762
So? Is that a bad thing?

29:25.180 --> 29:28.391
Oh, so I ended up like this
because of the way I behave?

29:28.475 --> 29:29.726
It's all my fault.

29:29.809 --> 29:32.312
There's no way
I'm going to restart my career now,

29:32.395 --> 29:34.606
so I should just sell weight loss pills
on Insta.

29:34.689 --> 29:36.024
Is that what you're saying?

29:36.107 --> 29:37.400
I never said that.

29:37.484 --> 29:40.570
I'm going to sort the recyclables
however the fuck I want to as well.

29:40.653 --> 29:43.239
Don't you fucking tell me
where to put what, goddamn it!

30:07.889 --> 30:09.432
You should've kept it together.

30:24.280 --> 30:26.407
Don't you think
you brought it on yourself?

31:01.150 --> 31:02.110
Hey, Kooksu.

31:02.193 --> 31:05.697
You know Doona from Dream Sweet
or whatever that you were crazy about?

31:06.197 --> 31:07.949
Yes! The Goddess Doona!

31:08.032 --> 31:09.909
- What about her?
- Is she sick by any chance?

31:09.993 --> 31:13.037
I hear it's common among celebrities.
Like mental health issues.

31:13.121 --> 31:14.831
Maybe she suffered from cyberbullying?

31:15.832 --> 31:17.292
Of course not!

31:17.375 --> 31:20.003
Doona is the type to do
whatever the hell she wants.

31:20.086 --> 31:23.131
She's only left the band to focus
on her studies for the time being.

31:23.214 --> 31:25.216
Only trust the facts, my friend.

31:25.300 --> 31:27.719
- Is that a fact?
- Trust me!

31:27.802 --> 31:30.388
But why are you asking about my Doona?

31:32.056 --> 31:34.517
- Are you also a fan now?
- Oh, don't be ridiculous.

31:34.601 --> 31:36.352
She just popped into my head.

31:36.853 --> 31:37.770
Yeah.

31:38.438 --> 31:41.566
I've been thinking
about her a lot today too.

31:41.649 --> 31:42.734
How much is that?

31:42.817 --> 31:43.651
Why?

32:45.129 --> 32:47.590
What? Do you have something to say?

32:52.971 --> 32:54.013
Have you eaten yet?

32:58.518 --> 33:00.770
I made too much food for dinner.

33:02.271 --> 33:03.731
If you haven't, could you wait?

33:03.815 --> 33:06.317
- I'll go and bring some for you.
- No need.

33:30.383 --> 33:31.217
Listen, here.

33:31.968 --> 33:34.762
It's the rule to give prior notice
before bringing someone.

33:34.846 --> 33:37.473
Well, I didn't exactly bring her, as such.

33:38.516 --> 33:41.144
- She does live in this house too.
- Exactly!

33:41.728 --> 33:44.397
You should be the one
to notify how antisocial you are

33:44.981 --> 33:46.274
so she can avoid you.

33:49.777 --> 33:52.613
Just ignore this heartless jerk.

33:53.656 --> 33:57.118
Come and visit us any time you want. Okay?

34:12.425 --> 34:14.719
Can I ask you something?

34:15.762 --> 34:18.139
You really don't have to answer
if you don't want to.

34:18.723 --> 34:20.600
Okay. Go ahead.

34:21.684 --> 34:22.852
Why did you quit?

34:27.440 --> 34:30.151
Maybe it's because
I've never achieved anything in my life,

34:30.985 --> 34:33.613
but I can't imagine someone like you

34:34.280 --> 34:35.698
throwing the towel in.

34:38.117 --> 34:40.578
I'm sorry.
You must be sick of questions like this.

34:41.996 --> 34:44.540
No. You're the first.

34:45.750 --> 34:46.584
Really?

34:47.168 --> 34:49.921
People prefer to believe
what they want to believe.

34:50.004 --> 34:52.465
The real reason isn't important to them.

34:57.720 --> 34:59.013
Cutting to the chase,

35:01.015 --> 35:02.225
nothing happened.

35:04.977 --> 35:06.562
It's just that all of a sudden,

35:09.774 --> 35:10.942
I couldn't sing anymore.

35:12.777 --> 35:13.653
That's all.

35:32.839 --> 35:34.173
Do you have any coins?

35:37.218 --> 35:38.136
Good luck!

35:40.012 --> 35:41.389
Here I go.

35:58.072 --> 35:58.990
Seriously?

35:59.073 --> 35:59.907
No!

36:07.081 --> 36:08.499
- What? All of this?
- Yep.

36:12.962 --> 36:13.880
Come on, hurry!

36:14.589 --> 36:15.506
Here.

36:33.191 --> 36:34.609
You should've kept it together.

36:35.610 --> 36:38.237
I told you today's an important day.
Let's talk after this.

36:42.283 --> 36:44.535
Dream Sweet, you're on in three minutes!

36:44.619 --> 36:45.786
We're starting now!

36:45.870 --> 36:47.288
I can't sing.

36:47.872 --> 36:49.373
What's that supposed to mean?

36:49.874 --> 36:51.417
I can't do it.

36:53.336 --> 36:55.463
You will do it. No matter what.

36:56.172 --> 36:58.090
I don't have time
for your childish antics.

37:05.056 --> 37:06.098
Ten seconds!

37:10.353 --> 37:11.354
Five seconds!

37:11.437 --> 37:13.147
Four. Three.

37:13.231 --> 37:14.440
Two.

37:53.646 --> 37:55.356
Stop this game

37:55.439 --> 37:57.108
Waited for it

37:57.191 --> 38:01.570
I now appear before your eyes

38:01.654 --> 38:03.155
Whisper spell

38:03.239 --> 38:04.782
You can't escape

38:04.865 --> 38:07.201
I got you

38:07.285 --> 38:08.536
Come to me

38:09.120 --> 38:11.414
You can't see anything now

38:11.497 --> 38:12.999
Both your eyes are blinded

38:13.082 --> 38:15.584
And you got a no choices

38:15.668 --> 38:16.961
I hypnotize you

38:17.670 --> 38:21.257
Screaming out so loud…

38:21.757 --> 38:24.385
Hey, Lee Doona!
You've really let yourself go!

38:27.221 --> 38:29.098
Could you hold this in your mouth for me?

38:30.308 --> 38:33.936
You make it burning, burning, burning

38:38.149 --> 38:40.860
- Do you really have to make it so obvious?
- Is she for real?

38:42.987 --> 38:45.239
If you want attention,
save it for your solo career.

38:53.748 --> 38:55.624
This is plagiarism!

38:55.708 --> 38:57.835
They're identical
even down to the composition!

38:57.918 --> 38:58.794
You!

38:59.378 --> 39:00.546
You'll lose everything

39:00.629 --> 39:03.215
and end up
selling weight loss pills on Insta.

39:10.306 --> 39:12.266
- Isn't that Lee Doona?
- What's wrong?

39:12.350 --> 39:13.267
What's going on?

39:21.942 --> 39:23.069
Doona.

39:23.152 --> 39:24.153
Lee Doona.

39:25.196 --> 39:26.364
Wake up.

39:27.490 --> 39:28.407
Lee Doona!

39:37.708 --> 39:38.626
I've done it!

39:47.551 --> 39:48.886
- Let's go.
- Okay.

39:59.814 --> 40:03.109
- It was my birthday today, you know.
- Oh, really?

40:03.609 --> 40:06.487
And I just happened to make
birthday seaweed soup today? Wow.

40:07.947 --> 40:11.283
You should try to eat better.
It feels sad when you don't eat properly.

40:11.367 --> 40:13.244
It helps to plate things up nicely too.

40:14.245 --> 40:17.665
I've realized that eating well is
the only thing I can do for myself.

40:22.628 --> 40:23.546
How about you?

40:24.213 --> 40:26.090
Why didn't it work out with Jin-ju?

40:28.884 --> 40:32.430
Well, isn't that just how crushes go?

40:33.431 --> 40:36.183
You foolishly read way too much
into every little detail,

40:36.809 --> 40:39.770
plunging into the depths of despair
and floating among the clouds.

40:39.854 --> 40:41.647
Then you go overboard

40:42.815 --> 40:44.775
and drift apart.

40:47.903 --> 40:51.073
- Are you sure she doesn't like you too?
- Absolutely sure.

40:51.157 --> 40:52.324
You may be wrong.

40:52.408 --> 40:53.409
How do you know?

40:53.492 --> 40:54.785
You can make it wrong.

40:54.869 --> 40:56.078
Right. So, how?

40:56.787 --> 40:58.539
You've got to make her heart pound.

40:59.248 --> 41:01.876
Girls like Jin-ju tend to like
that kind of stuff.

41:01.959 --> 41:03.210
You know, right?

41:03.294 --> 41:04.920
Bam, against the wall like this.

41:06.422 --> 41:09.383
Try it. Push her against any wall.

41:09.467 --> 41:12.553
Then look at her without saying a word.

41:12.636 --> 41:13.721
For ten seconds.

41:14.305 --> 41:16.640
No, ten is too long.
Five seconds is enough.

41:17.892 --> 41:18.767
And then…

41:21.479 --> 41:22.480
And then what?

41:26.817 --> 41:28.736
You have to come up with the next part.

41:29.236 --> 41:31.030
I can't do everything for you.

41:32.072 --> 41:33.407
You're too demanding.

41:37.786 --> 41:38.996
Want to practice with me?

41:39.830 --> 41:40.998
I'll tell you

41:41.582 --> 41:43.459
if my heart starts pounding or not.

42:02.561 --> 42:03.979
Happy birthday.

42:09.235 --> 42:11.028
See? It doesn't work.

42:13.697 --> 42:16.283
Your birthday is over now.
Let's go in. It's really late.

43:13.007 --> 43:14.258
Were you sleeping?

43:16.051 --> 43:16.885
No.

43:19.346 --> 43:21.181
Why? Do you have something to tell me?

43:23.100 --> 43:26.353
There's nothing going on
between Doona and me.

43:26.437 --> 43:28.314
It seemed like you got the wrong idea.

43:29.565 --> 43:31.483
I just wanted to set the record straight.

43:34.194 --> 43:35.029
Yeah?

43:36.947 --> 43:37.906
Okay.

43:42.244 --> 43:43.287
I'm glad.

43:50.502 --> 43:52.713
Happy birthday. I'll be in touch.

47:29.012 --> 47:34.017
Subtitle translation by: Reuben Simpson
